# Ran and Shaw's enters trigger needs three or more Dragon and/or Lesson cards in YOUR graveyard (CR 603.4): with two Firebending
# Lessons in Bot1's graveyard, casting Ran and Shaw on turn 5 makes no copy. The intervening "if" is false as it would trigger, so nothing goes on the stack.

